	.string "on ROUTE 36, it jumped!\p"
	.string "I think it must be a POKéMON.\n"
	.string "But it would take someone like\l"
	.string "WHITNEY, our GYM LEADER, to beat it.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior6_Text_Picnicker_2::
